  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Seijo wa Akujo ni Naritai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生聖女は悪女になりたい"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Overworked office drone Kokomi collapses during overtime—\nand wakes up as Cocoaush, the protagonist of a certain story.\n\nShunned by her family and neglected by her fiancé, Cocoaush was originally destined to persevere through hardship, work diligently, and eventually go down in history as a saint…\n\nBut Kokomi’s had enough of being the good girl!\n\nIt's time for a corporate slave to rewrite her life from the ground up!!",
   "ja": "働き詰めの社畜OL・心実が残業中に倒れて目を覚ますと、とある物語の主人公・ココアーシュになっていた。家族から疎まれ、婚約者からも冷遇されるもめげることなく努力を重ね、仕事をこなし――そしてのちに聖女として語り継がれることになるのが彼女の本来の人生だけど…？ いい子ちゃんはもうごめんです！ 社畜OLの人生やり直し計画!!"
  },
